'''Widow''' is a [[boss]] that can appear in the {{s|Cellar}}.

== Behavior ==
Widow makes large leaps towards Isaac, at approximately double the distance of {{e|Monstro}}, and can perform the following attacks after landing:
* Leaves a puddle of [[Creep#White|White Creep]] and spawns a {{e|Sack}}.
** There is a maximum of 3 Sacks alive at once.
* Spits out a {{e|Spider}}.
* Widow can kill her own Spiders and Sacks if she jumps on top of them.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|18}}: Spawns {{e|Big Spider}}s with half health instead of Sacks, [[Black Creep]] instead of White, and spits out six blood shots instead of Spiders.
: {{bc|20}}: Spawns {{e|Boil}}s instead of Sacks and {{e|Attack Fly|text=Attack Flies}} instead of Spiders. Jumps quicker. {{dlc|r}} She is also 25% smaller and has 10% less health (117 HP).

