== Trivia ==
* Widow was added in the ''Wrath of the Lamb'' DLC for the original ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* She is the boss version of the {{e|Trite}}s.
* {{e|The Wretched}} is the posthumous version of her.
* The name probably refers to the ''[[wikipedia: Latrodectus|Latrodectus]]'', commonly known as "black widow spider".
* {{Dlc|r}} Widow's and The Wretched's animations and behavior have been sped up to more closely resemble their Flash counterparts.

